1
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:11,746
(This story is entirely fictional)

2
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:14,880
Hello?

3
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:16,760
Mom.

4
00:00:18,039 --> 00:00:19,280
I'm downstairs.

5
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,039
I've got a surprise for you.

6
00:00:29,839 --> 00:00:31,000
(Based on Doctor Qin: Executer)
Nervous?

7
00:00:32,359 --> 00:00:33,960
You're meeting my mom.

8
00:00:34,679 --> 00:00:36,399
Not me meeting yours.

9
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,000
Wait,

10
00:00:38,359 --> 00:00:39,359
are you nervous?

11
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,159
Why would I be?

12
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:45,359
I'm just meeting my ex-girlfriend.

13
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:56,640
=Doctor Qin: Executer=
=Episode 3=

14
00:01:10,359 --> 00:01:11,159
Mom.

15
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:13,000
I'm home.

16
00:01:13,799 --> 00:01:14,640
Look

17
00:01:15,519 --> 00:01:16,560
who's here.

18
00:01:18,799 --> 00:01:20,000
I got off work late.

19
00:01:20,239 --> 00:01:22,400
Tang brought me here for dinner.

20
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:33,480
Mr. Zhang,

21
00:01:33,959 --> 00:01:35,359
I didn't expect you to come.

22
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:37,239
I didn't prepare anything special.

23
00:01:37,799 --> 00:01:38,640
It's fine.

24
00:01:40,519 --> 00:01:41,680
My mom's not

25
00:01:41,719 --> 00:01:43,159
as good a cook as me.

26
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:44,760
If you want something good,

27
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,640
I'll cook for you next time.

28
00:01:51,319 --> 00:01:52,120
Mr. Zhang,

29
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:54,120
Tang is young,

30
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,200
immature,

31
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,200
and lacks proper manners.

32
00:01:57,599 --> 00:01:59,640
She's not fit for someone
as refined as you.

33
00:02:02,439 --> 00:02:03,239
Tang,

34
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:06,000
go change into something more proper.

35
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:11,000
I think she looks fine like this.

36
00:02:11,039 --> 00:02:12,199
She's young.

37
00:02:12,439 --> 00:02:13,639
That's how it should be.

38
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:14,840
Free-spirited.

39
00:02:15,639 --> 00:02:16,439
Bold.

40
00:02:17,199 --> 00:02:18,840
Why follow so many rules?

41
00:02:19,919 --> 00:02:20,960
Just look at yourself.

42
00:02:22,439 --> 00:02:24,759
You're getting more and more boring.

43
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,599
Yeah.

44
00:02:27,319 --> 00:02:29,039
Dong says I'm a lot of fun.

45
00:02:30,039 --> 00:02:30,840
He says

46
00:02:31,719 --> 00:02:33,479
you must've taught me well!

47
00:02:33,479 --> 00:02:35,199
I never taught you any of this!

48
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:37,800
Dong,

49
00:02:38,759 --> 00:02:39,719
sorry you had to see that.

50
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:41,319
I never thought she'd start doing

51
00:02:41,319 --> 00:02:42,879
such shameless things.

52
00:02:42,879 --> 00:02:44,319
She has no dignity at all!

53
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,199
That's right.

54
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,560
Mom, you're absolutely right.

55
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:50,120
I may not have your dignity,

56
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:53,520
but don't we end up the same anyway?

57
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,159
Mom.

58
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:07,319
Do you really think
you're controlling men?

59
00:03:08,039 --> 00:03:09,840
At your age,

60
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:12,319
dressing up like a young girl every day,

61
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:15,120
don't you get tired?

62
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:18,280
After you take off your makeup,

63
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,800
looking at yourself in the mirror,

64
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:23,919
don't you find it disgusting?

65
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:31,360
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

66
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:35,520
I should never have had you!

67
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,759
I'll kill you myself today!

68
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:41,960
♪Tang in the cage says not a word♪

69
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:48,599
♪The curled-up girl misses her mom♪

70
00:03:49,479 --> 00:03:53,079
♪Every word from Mom cuts deep♪

71
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:56,680
♪Every word from Mom cuts deep♪

72
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:04,520
♪Fresh wounds pile upon old scars♪

73
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:17,480
I told you long ago

74
00:04:17,759 --> 00:04:19,240
you can't raise a child right.

75
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,519
Besides,

76
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:25,879
like mother, like daughter,

77
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:27,959
isn't that a good thing?

78
00:04:31,879 --> 00:04:32,759
We're family.

79
00:04:33,759 --> 00:04:36,360
Can't we just eat together in peace?

80
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:45,240
Now you've ruined my mood.

81
00:04:57,519 --> 00:04:58,879
Can you tell us

82
00:04:58,879 --> 00:05:00,399
more about your mother?

83
00:05:05,959 --> 00:05:06,759
Mr. Xu.

84
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:08,519
Don't worry.

85
00:05:08,519 --> 00:05:10,160
I'm keeping an eye on the project.

86
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:10,920
Next time you come,

87
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,680
just let me know in advance.

88
00:05:13,639 --> 00:05:15,160
I'll arrange everything for you.

89
00:05:20,319 --> 00:05:21,120
Tang.

90
00:05:21,279 --> 00:05:22,079
You're back.

91
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,319
Give me your backpack.

92
00:05:23,959 --> 00:05:25,120
I'm going to do my homework.

93
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:30,279
Wipe that stuff off your mouth.

94
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:35,319
Can't you hear me?

95
00:05:35,839 --> 00:05:37,160
At your age, learn something decent,

96
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,319
not how to seduce men!

97
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,639
I'm seducing men?

98
00:05:42,639 --> 00:05:43,759
What men?

99
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:46,279
Is that how you talk to me?

100
00:05:46,279 --> 00:05:48,040
You just answered the phone,

101
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:49,480
Hello?

102
00:05:50,279 --> 00:05:51,079
Mr. Xu.

103
00:05:51,759 --> 00:05:53,680
I'll arrange everything
for you next time.

104
00:05:55,279 --> 00:05:57,279
Isn't that just seducing him?

105
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:59,079
I'll say this one last time.

106
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:01,439
Wipe that stuff off your mouth!

107
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,360
My mom...

108
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,000
She hates me

109
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:43,959
because my existence

110
00:06:44,839 --> 00:06:46,759
is proof of her failure,

111
00:06:47,399 --> 00:06:51,000
(Quit Addiction, Start Fresh)
proof that a man dumped her like trash.

112
00:06:51,839 --> 00:06:53,879
Zhang Xiaodong ruined me.

113
00:06:54,639 --> 00:06:55,800
But what did she do?

114
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,480
She took all her hatred,

115
00:07:00,199 --> 00:07:01,560
all her humiliation

116
00:07:02,279 --> 00:07:04,199
out on me!

117
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:05,879
Are you saying

118
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,800
Zhang Xiaodong
got you addicted to drugs?

119
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:10,279
Yes.

120
00:07:13,439 --> 00:07:14,639
Not exactly.

121
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:19,639
Someone told me later

122
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:22,480
that even without Zhang Xiaodong,

123
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:28,279
there would've been another guy

124
00:07:29,839 --> 00:07:31,480
to corrupt me.

125
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:34,000
It wasn't those men.

126
00:07:35,519 --> 00:07:37,160
It was my mom!

127
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,360
That person said

128
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,639
if I wanted to be truly clean,

129
00:07:44,079 --> 00:07:46,000
I had to erase all the filth

130
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:48,079
my mom had brought!

131
00:07:49,879 --> 00:07:50,680
Su Tang.

132
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:54,000
Su Tang!

133
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:55,600
Who was that person?

134
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:01,040
How did he contact you?

135
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:02,279
I...

136
00:08:04,959 --> 00:08:06,800
I don't know either.

137
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:07,920
He...

138
00:08:09,399 --> 00:08:11,240
was like a shadow.

139
00:08:13,839 --> 00:08:14,839
He said

140
00:08:15,959 --> 00:08:17,360
he could save me!

141
00:08:20,959 --> 00:08:22,800
But is there still hope

142
00:08:25,079 --> 00:08:26,879
for someone like me?

143
00:08:28,279 --> 00:08:29,079
Tang.

144
00:08:29,839 --> 00:08:31,079
Drink your anti-addiction medicine.

145
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,639
If you won't let me out,

146
00:08:38,639 --> 00:08:40,080
I won't take a single sip!

147
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,480
Let me go!

148
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:43,879
Let go!

149
00:08:45,799 --> 00:08:46,759
I hate you.

150
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:48,759
I hate you most of all!

151
00:08:52,679 --> 00:08:54,080
Good. You should hate me!

152
00:08:54,759 --> 00:08:56,600
When you can act properly,

153
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,639
I'll let you out.

154
00:09:29,559 --> 00:09:30,879
Tang, time to eat.

155
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:33,840
Tang?

156
00:09:37,159 --> 00:09:37,960
Tang?

157
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,159
Tang?

158
00:09:48,399 --> 00:09:49,200
Tang?

159
00:09:51,279 --> 00:09:52,080
Tang?

160
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,240
Tang?

161
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:55,480
What's going on?

162
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:58,799
Come on.

163
00:10:04,039 --> 00:10:05,639
Tang!

164
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,399
Tang, what are you doing?

165
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,480
I'll make you feel what it's like

166
00:10:10,639 --> 00:10:11,759
to be locked up

167
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,799
and begging for death!

168
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:15,840
Tang.

169
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,200
Open it.

170
00:10:17,279 --> 00:10:18,279
I'm your mom.

171
00:10:18,279 --> 00:10:19,080
Open it.

172
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:20,879
And I'm your daughter!

173
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:24,639
Where's the money?

174
00:10:24,879 --> 00:10:26,240
Where did you hide it?

175
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:30,759
You want to watch me die?

176
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:33,120
Tell me!

177
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:35,679
The southeast corner.

178
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:39,080
Under the third flowerpot.

179
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:44,279
You'll never amount to anything!

180
00:11:09,960 --> 00:11:12,440
You had this money ready all along.

181
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:16,320
You always wanted to get rid of me,
this filthy burden.

182
00:11:16,519 --> 00:11:17,360
Didn't you?

183
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:26,159
You can curse at me.

184
00:11:27,159 --> 00:11:28,559
You can hit me.

185
00:11:30,279 --> 00:11:32,320
You can lock me up.

186
00:11:33,919 --> 00:11:35,960
But you can't get rid of me!

187
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:40,639
You turned me into this.

188
00:11:41,559 --> 00:11:43,919
Now you want some peace?

189
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:45,919
Not a chance!

190
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:50,720
Say something!

191
00:11:52,519 --> 00:11:55,159
Don't you love judging me?

192
00:11:55,759 --> 00:11:57,279
Why so quiet now?

193
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:07,240
You hate me depending on men.

194
00:12:11,639 --> 00:12:12,919
So what about this money?

195
00:12:14,159 --> 00:12:15,919
Is this money clean?

196
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,159
Tang...

197
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,279
Tang...

198
00:12:47,879 --> 00:12:48,679
Tang...

199
00:12:49,639 --> 00:12:50,559
Tang...

200
00:12:52,279 --> 00:12:53,200
Tang...

201
00:13:07,519 --> 00:13:08,320
Dr. Qin,

202
00:13:08,879 --> 00:13:11,200
The trace team lifted
a clear fingerprint

203
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:12,759
from the window boards.

204
00:13:12,799 --> 00:13:14,240
It doesn't match Su Tang or Su Shi.

205
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:18,679
This fingerprint

206
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:21,600
likely belongs to the peeper.

207
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:26,039
This is the third person's fingerprint

208
00:13:26,039 --> 00:13:27,720
we found at the scene.

209
00:13:30,580 --> 00:13:32,160
(Only my way can truly cleanse you
and set you free.)

210
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,080
Before the murder,

211
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:35,720
you were in constant contact
with this number.

212
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,120
See for yourself.

213
00:13:41,559 --> 00:13:42,360
Su Tang.

214
00:13:44,279 --> 00:13:46,639
Were you brainwashed

215
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:47,879
by all these baseless lies?

216
00:13:48,879 --> 00:13:50,720
As long as my mom is alive,

217
00:13:51,879 --> 00:13:53,120
I'll always be filthy

218
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,639
in her eyes!

219
00:13:55,879 --> 00:13:57,679
But she's your mother.

220
00:13:58,279 --> 00:13:59,840
Only when she's dead

221
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:02,519
can I be completely clean!

222
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:04,799
(She saved up all that money)

223
00:14:05,039 --> 00:14:06,519
(because she wanted to run away)

224
00:14:07,039 --> 00:14:09,080
(and leave you alone in this mess.)

225
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:11,840
(What she calls "for your own good")

226
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:13,200
(is chaining you down)

227
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:15,159
(so you'll never be free.)

228
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:17,919
(Only my way)

229
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:19,879
(can truly cleanse you)

230
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:21,399
(and set you free.)

231
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:25,440
(She locked you up,)

232
00:14:26,279 --> 00:14:27,600
(claiming it was for your protection.)

233
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:30,519
(But really, she was jealous
of your youth.)

234
00:14:31,559 --> 00:14:32,120
Yes...

235
00:14:35,039 --> 00:14:36,720
She was jealous of me.

236
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:40,519
She was jealous of me.

237
00:14:40,519 --> 00:14:41,279
Tang...

238
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:43,519
Tang...

239
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:48,720
(She locked you up to “protect” you,
but she just envied your youth.)

240
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:55,080
Don't become like me...

241
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:58,440
Don't become like me...

242
00:15:01,279 --> 00:15:02,240
(She's fading. I'm scared.)
(Stay firm.)

243
00:15:02,799 --> 00:15:04,240
(And you'll be reborn.)

244
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:07,399
You're just jealous of me!

245
00:15:08,679 --> 00:15:10,960
Your own daughter!

246
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:12,159
Why couldn't I keep my hair long?

247
00:15:12,159 --> 00:15:13,519
Why couldn't I wear skirts?

248
00:15:13,919 --> 00:15:16,600
You were just afraid I'd steal your men!

249
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:20,279
You wanted me
to become as filthy as you.

250
00:15:23,799 --> 00:15:25,840
Only if you disappear,

251
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:27,759
only if half the blood in me

252
00:15:27,759 --> 00:15:29,600
that came from you is gone

253
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:31,000
can I be clean!

254
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:44,519
Su Tang,

255
00:15:45,279 --> 00:15:46,679
these are your mother's belongings.

256
00:15:47,600 --> 00:15:48,679
Since you were born,

257
00:15:48,679 --> 00:15:50,399
she kept a record of your life.

258
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:52,799
Seventeen boxes in all.

259
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:54,759
Maybe,

260
00:15:55,279 --> 00:15:56,919
you'd like to hear

261
00:15:56,919 --> 00:15:58,200
your mother's truest voice.

262
00:16:02,519 --> 00:16:03,440
(Some day,)

263
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:05,600
(I'll leave everything I have)

264
00:16:06,279 --> 00:16:07,279
(to her)

265
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:09,519
(and die alone.)

266
00:16:20,820 --> 00:16:24,853
♪Sunset washes over the old wall♪

267
00:16:25,410 --> 00:16:29,560
♪Milk tea cools on the stone steps♪

268
00:16:29,733 --> 00:16:33,410
♪Sea wind tugs at your sleeve♪

269
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:37,986
♪Unspoken words just flee and fade♪

270
00:16:47,026 --> 00:16:50,700
♪The marks on the desk
have faded yellow♪

271
00:16:51,040 --> 00:16:53,420
♪I turned around,
and a gunshot rang out♪

272
00:16:54,540 --> 00:16:58,160
♪No one can truly feel another's pain♪

273
00:16:58,226 --> 00:17:01,980
♪The wind is cold,
a fading shadow sways♪

274
00:17:02,306 --> 00:17:06,580
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

275
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:10,960
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

276
00:17:12,053 --> 00:17:15,240
♪A bullet pierces the spring night♪

277
00:17:16,013 --> 00:17:19,900
♪You sink into the vast crowd♪

278
00:17:28,890 --> 00:17:32,680
♪Years later, when we meet again♪

279
00:17:33,093 --> 00:17:36,970
♪Don't mention this moonlit night♪

280
00:17:37,540 --> 00:17:40,880
♪The waves smooth
two lines of footprints♪

281
00:17:41,040 --> 00:17:43,890
♪Half a cup of sweetness
sinks into the sand♪

282
00:17:43,946 --> 00:17:48,610
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

283
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:53,000
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

284
00:17:53,580 --> 00:17:55,770
♪Wind back to shore,
clouds back to hills♪

285
00:17:55,826 --> 00:17:57,570
♪We stop here in this night♪

286
00:17:57,866 --> 00:18:02,260
♪This is the past, the only,
the last look back♪

